            </div>

            <nav class="space-y-8">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-charcoal text-sm mb-3 px-2">Introduction</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-1">
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Documentation Hub</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/getting-started/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Getting Started</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-charcoal text-sm mb-3 px-2">Core Concepts</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-1">
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/manifest-reference/" class="sidebar-link active block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium rounded-r-md transition-colors">Manifest Reference</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/rules-and-targets/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Rules &amp; Targets</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/templating/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Templating</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/standard-library/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Standard Library</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-charcoal text-sm mb-3 px-2">Reference</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-1">
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/cli/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">CLI Commands</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/configuration/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Configuration</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/netsuke/docs/security/" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Security Model</a></li>
                    </ul>
